WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.900
=Episode 36=

01:40.150 --> 01:40.990
It is

01:41.830 --> 01:43.110
the war drums being beaten.

01:48.990 --> 01:49.830
Commander.

01:50.110 --> 01:50.950
Crisis at the border.

01:51.509 --> 01:52.390
Wutuo attacks Mingshui

01:52.550 --> 01:53.789
and Huayuan simultaneously.

01:55.870 --> 01:57.470
No time to waste. Go to the palace now.

02:01.970 --> 02:03.790
(Longtai Hall)

02:03.790 --> 02:05.910
Wutuo actually broke the peace treaty

02:05.990 --> 02:07.190
and invaded us again.

02:07.990 --> 02:09.190
That's so unscrupulous!

02:10.070 --> 02:10.910
Xiao Jue.

02:11.030 --> 02:12.510
You lead troops to Mingshui.

02:12.630 --> 02:14.670
This time, we must teach Wutuo a lesson

02:14.670 --> 02:16.510
and ensure
they never dare invade us again.

02:17.190 --> 02:18.750
As you command.

02:19.670 --> 02:20.510
He Yan.

02:20.750 --> 02:22.150
I order you to lead the Fuyue Army

02:22.710 --> 02:24.230
and defend Rundu with Li Kuang

02:24.710 --> 02:26.030
to guard against Wutuo's raids.

02:27.150 --> 02:27.990
Your Majesty.

02:28.070 --> 02:29.150
There's no battle in Rundu.

02:29.670 --> 02:30.550
Yet Wutuo's forces

02:30.950 --> 02:31.990
are approaching Huayuan.

02:32.190 --> 02:33.030
It's threatening.

02:35.150 --> 02:36.310
There's no current conflict,

02:36.790 --> 02:38.829
but Wutuo is full of tricks.

02:39.470 --> 02:40.310
We must be alert.

02:40.950 --> 02:41.790
As for Huayuan,

02:42.430 --> 02:43.510
I've sent Yan He there,

02:44.190 --> 02:46.470
with Chu Zhao as military supervisor

02:46.870 --> 02:47.710
to assist.

02:54.790 --> 02:57.230
Yes, understood.

03:12.590 --> 03:14.110
His Majesty wants me to guard Rundu,

03:14.350 --> 03:15.390
but Li Kuang is there.

03:15.590 --> 03:16.590
Why send me too?

03:17.190 --> 03:18.030
In my opinion,

03:18.390 --> 03:19.790
His Majesty still distrusts us.

03:19.990 --> 03:22.150
An emperor's balance of power
is an age-old strategy.

03:22.590 --> 03:23.790
But there's wisdom

03:24.150 --> 03:25.350
in this arrangement.

03:26.150 --> 03:28.350
Rundu lies between Huayuan and Mingshui.

03:28.670 --> 03:31.470
It allows quick support to both cities.

03:32.310 --> 03:33.150
Promise me

03:33.470 --> 03:34.829
you'll return safely.

03:37.230 --> 03:38.670
Take Wang Ba's team

03:39.070 --> 03:40.350
to Rundu with you.

03:40.990 --> 03:42.070
There's no battle there.

03:42.510 --> 03:43.670
Keep them with you.

03:44.030 --> 03:45.550
I have Feinu and Shen Han.

03:46.070 --> 03:46.990
With them guarding you,

03:47.310 --> 03:48.150
I'll feel assured.

03:49.710 --> 03:50.550
Okay.

03:56.270 --> 03:57.110
Miss He.

04:03.870 --> 04:05.670
Congratulations.
You've won imperial favor

04:06.350 --> 04:08.230
and secured the supervisor position.

04:38.270 --> 04:40.350
A little tiger is roaring.

04:41.110 --> 04:42.870
A little tiger is roaring.

04:43.790 --> 04:45.670
A little tiger is roaring.

04:49.710 --> 04:50.550
What's wrong?

04:50.950 --> 04:51.790
The baby kicked me.

04:54.790 --> 04:55.830
Behave yourself,

04:56.470 --> 04:58.710
or I'll punish you when I return.

04:58.950 --> 05:00.350
Don't threaten our baby.

05:08.110 --> 05:08.950
Yan He.

05:10.070 --> 05:10.910
This time,

05:11.670 --> 05:13.110
let me go with you.

05:14.230 --> 05:16.990
I went along with troops before.

05:18.590 --> 05:19.550
This is different!

05:19.950 --> 05:21.470
You're pregnant now.

05:22.630 --> 05:24.390
The due date is still weeks away.

05:25.790 --> 05:26.630
Besides,

05:27.310 --> 05:28.430
as a general's wife,

05:29.030 --> 05:30.830
I can endure hardships.

05:33.190 --> 05:34.030
Fine.

05:34.590 --> 05:36.310
I'll stay by your side

05:36.590 --> 05:37.790
and see the birth of our baby.

05:43.070 --> 05:45.590
I'll be the best father in the capital.

05:53.970 --> 05:59.680
(Xiao Mansion)

05:59.680 --> 06:05.380
(Xiao Mansion)

06:09.470 --> 06:10.390
You guys

06:10.910 --> 06:11.990
focus on the war.

06:12.510 --> 06:14.350
My wife and I will handle home affairs.

06:23.030 --> 06:23.870
Miss He.

06:23.910 --> 06:25.030
May you return safely.

06:53.040 --> 06:56.930
(Xiao Mansion)

07:08.980 --> 07:12.320
(Rundu City)

07:40.950 --> 07:42.630
General He, time to eat.

08:03.070 --> 08:03.910
General He.

08:04.390 --> 08:06.430
I heard you returned
to write battle reports.

08:07.150 --> 08:08.070
Haven't started yet?

08:10.150 --> 08:11.030
Nothing to report.

08:11.630 --> 08:12.750
Wutuo forces

08:12.950 --> 08:14.310
continue assaults on Huayuan

08:14.670 --> 08:15.510
and Mingshui,

08:15.910 --> 08:17.390
while Rundu remains peaceful.

08:19.150 --> 08:19.990
General.

08:23.830 --> 08:24.870
General! Emergency!

08:25.830 --> 08:26.710
New battle report.

08:26.870 --> 08:28.110
Wutuo sent reinforcements

08:28.190 --> 08:29.030
to attack Huayuan.

08:30.190 --> 08:32.390
General Yan has fought nonstop
for two days.

08:34.710 --> 08:35.950
- Mai.
- Yes.

08:35.950 --> 08:36.909
You go tell Li Kuang

08:37.110 --> 08:38.309
that I'll leave 5,000 soldiers

08:38.429 --> 08:39.309
to defend the city.

08:40.870 --> 08:43.990
The rest will reinforce Huayuan with me.

08:44.670 --> 08:45.510
- Yes.
- Yes.

08:50.480 --> 08:53.600
(He)

09:12.150 --> 09:13.790
I heard you all rushed here

09:13.910 --> 09:14.790
from Rundu

09:15.150 --> 09:16.590
and repelled enemies with Yan He.

09:17.390 --> 09:18.510
I've prepared a banquet

09:19.070 --> 09:19.990
to honor your victory.

09:21.150 --> 09:24.550
- Great.
- Great.

09:24.870 --> 09:29.110
- Great.
- Great.

09:39.830 --> 09:42.070
Xiu, I'm back.

09:46.110 --> 09:47.030
He has returned.

10:14.950 --> 10:15.790
Madam.

10:15.990 --> 10:16.830
What's wrong?

10:24.390 --> 10:25.230
Careful, Madam.

10:26.230 --> 10:27.070
What's happening?

10:28.830 --> 10:29.670
Someone!

10:29.790 --> 10:30.870
Madam is going into labor.

10:31.030 --> 10:32.030
Someone!

10:34.390 --> 10:35.310
- General Yan!
- General!

10:35.390 --> 10:36.350
- General!
- General Yan!

10:37.470 --> 10:38.310
Medic!

10:38.430 --> 10:39.270
Medic!

10:39.430 --> 10:40.270
Medic!

10:40.630 --> 10:41.470
Don't.

10:43.270 --> 10:44.470
Don't tell Xiu.

10:45.990 --> 10:47.470
She's pregnant.

10:48.310 --> 10:49.230
Don't alarm her.

10:50.630 --> 10:51.550
Hang in there!

10:52.030 --> 10:53.030
The medic is coming.

10:54.390 --> 10:55.390
Promise me.

11:02.190 --> 11:03.030
Xiu.

11:05.870 --> 11:06.710
I'm sorry.

11:42.630 --> 11:43.830
Take a deep breath and push!

11:43.830 --> 11:44.950
Deep breath, Madam.

11:44.990 --> 11:45.830
Keep pushing!

11:45.830 --> 11:46.670
Push harder!

11:47.670 --> 11:49.110
Push! Keep pushing!

11:49.110 --> 11:49.950
Breathe in.

11:50.510 --> 11:51.350
Breathe in.

11:51.550 --> 11:52.390
Breathe in.

11:53.670 --> 11:54.510
Madam.

11:54.510 --> 11:55.710
Y-Yan He...

11:57.030 --> 11:57.950
Push, Madam!

11:58.190 --> 11:59.150
Push! Hold your breath!

12:00.870 --> 12:02.070
Hold it! Keep holding!

12:02.190 --> 12:03.030
Hold your breath!

12:03.030 --> 12:03.870
Almost done!

12:04.110 --> 12:04.950
Yan He

12:06.390 --> 12:08.950
is still mopping up remaining enemies
behind the lines.

12:09.190 --> 12:10.550
He'll return later.

12:10.550 --> 12:11.390
Push harder, Madam!

12:11.990 --> 12:13.630
Hold your breath and push!

12:13.630 --> 12:14.470
That's it!

12:14.470 --> 12:15.710
Hold and push!

12:18.190 --> 12:19.030
It's born!

12:22.030 --> 12:22.870
Madam!

12:23.270 --> 12:24.150
Congratulations!

12:24.550 --> 12:25.430
It's a girl!

12:25.470 --> 12:26.310
She's born, Madam!

12:26.590 --> 12:27.950
She's beautiful!

12:28.310 --> 12:29.150
Careful.

12:37.430 --> 12:38.510
It's Muxia.

12:39.510 --> 12:40.350
Muxia?

12:42.550 --> 12:43.470
Yan He chose this name.

12:44.230 --> 12:45.430
Liangjiang for a boy,

12:46.430 --> 12:47.790
Muxia for a girl.

12:50.350 --> 12:51.190
Muxia,

12:52.070 --> 12:53.590
your father is a great hero.

12:54.270 --> 12:55.550
Muxia, you will grow up

12:55.790 --> 12:57.830
to carry on your father's legacy.

13:00.030 --> 13:00.870
Muxia

13:02.110 --> 13:03.590
will become

13:04.470 --> 13:05.830
a good general

13:06.030 --> 13:06.870
like her father.

13:13.350 --> 13:14.190
So adorable.

13:17.390 --> 13:18.270
Muxia.

13:19.270 --> 13:20.110
Muxia.

13:24.600 --> 13:27.040
(Yan)

14:02.630 --> 14:05.590
Are Mrs. Yan and the child safe?

14:06.510 --> 14:07.350
Safe?

14:07.790 --> 14:08.630
Yes,

14:09.190 --> 14:10.030
they're safe.

14:10.550 --> 14:13.150
But the child lost her father at birth.

14:13.870 --> 14:14.790
Father and daughter

14:15.870 --> 14:18.190
never even met.

14:18.910 --> 14:21.790
This battle could have ended sooner

14:22.950 --> 14:24.230
with fewer casualties.

14:25.270 --> 14:27.670
All because of your loyal advice,

14:28.910 --> 14:29.870
His Majesty

14:30.950 --> 14:33.230
feared our concentrated military power,

14:34.030 --> 14:34.870
ordering me

14:35.550 --> 14:37.350
to station the Fuyue Army in Rundu,

14:38.750 --> 14:40.150
scattering our forces.

14:41.030 --> 14:43.230
So, we couldn't deliver
a decisive blow to Wutuo.

14:48.070 --> 14:49.190
Is this the outcome

14:50.870 --> 14:52.070
you wanted,

14:52.790 --> 14:53.830
Mr. Chu?

15:05.670 --> 15:06.950
You don't deserve to get wasted.

15:09.070 --> 15:10.990
Stay sober and atone for this.

15:19.230 --> 15:20.070
This is

15:20.550 --> 15:21.710
to honor the fallen soldiers.

15:33.190 --> 15:34.590
(Zilan, you're smart and diligent.)

15:34.750 --> 15:36.190
You will earn scholarly honors.

15:38.430 --> 15:39.390
When you grow up,

15:39.790 --> 15:41.790
you'll become a good
and respectable official.

15:42.630 --> 15:44.990
(Then no one will
dare bully you anymore.)

15:50.710 --> 15:51.550
Mother.

15:51.670 --> 15:52.950
Don't cry, Zilan.

15:53.510 --> 15:54.790
I'm just tired.

15:56.190 --> 15:58.270
My poor son.

15:59.390 --> 16:02.590
(Mother, I'll take you away
from the Chu family.)

16:03.390 --> 16:05.950
We don't have to endure their insult.

16:09.550 --> 16:10.390
Mother.

16:10.870 --> 16:12.110
Mother!

16:12.430 --> 16:14.550
(I only fear)

16:15.790 --> 16:17.710
you'll end up alone.

16:20.270 --> 16:21.350
From now on,

16:22.350 --> 16:23.550
stop pushing yourself so hard.

16:25.430 --> 16:27.150
Spare yourself.

16:29.430 --> 16:32.160
♪Upon towering fortress walls♪

16:32.410 --> 16:35.010
♪Brooding over lamented pasts♪

16:35.190 --> 16:38.050
♪Where shall light be found♪

16:38.050 --> 16:40.000
♪Once♪

16:40.000 --> 16:43.070
♪I had an unbreakable faith♪

16:44.760 --> 16:45.840
You know what?

16:47.310 --> 16:48.150
You are

16:50.110 --> 16:52.110
becoming like Xu Jingfu.

16:52.110 --> 16:54.830
♪Resent old dreams like drifting clouds♪

16:55.110 --> 16:56.930
♪Heartache♪

16:56.930 --> 16:59.900
♪Resenting the lonely years♪

17:00.750 --> 17:01.590
I believed

17:02.990 --> 17:04.630
I upheld moral principles,

17:05.990 --> 17:07.510
unlike scum like Xu Jingfu.

17:09.390 --> 17:10.230
Now,

17:11.349 --> 17:12.910
stubbornness blinded me.

17:13.790 --> 17:14.829
Endless warfare,

17:15.710 --> 17:16.869
widespread suffering,

17:17.950 --> 17:19.190
families torn apart,

17:19.829 --> 17:21.150
all because of me.

17:23.349 --> 17:24.190
If the ruler

17:27.069 --> 17:28.830
and ministers had been united,

17:29.630 --> 17:30.830
with generals defending Wei,

17:32.110 --> 17:33.590
Wutuo would've never invaded!

17:41.870 --> 17:42.830
I was wrong.

17:59.910 --> 18:00.750
General He.

18:01.070 --> 18:01.910
Urgent news!

18:01.910 --> 18:02.830
It's Mingshui.

18:03.110 --> 18:04.310
After losing in Huayuan,

18:04.470 --> 18:05.870
Wutuo sent more troops to Mingshui.

18:06.230 --> 18:07.390
Their troops from Huayuan

18:07.630 --> 18:08.870
are already advancing there.

18:09.870 --> 18:11.150
The Xiao Army can't

18:11.550 --> 18:13.190
resist much longer with weak forces.

18:14.270 --> 18:15.390
We must reinforce them!

18:16.030 --> 18:17.830
Mr. Jiang, you stay here.

18:18.070 --> 18:20.350
Assist General Yan's deputy
in defending Huayuan.

18:20.830 --> 18:21.670
Understood!

18:39.470 --> 18:40.310
Xiao Jue!

18:40.670 --> 18:42.070
Surrender now,

18:42.510 --> 18:44.470
and I'll kindly spare your life.

18:45.030 --> 18:47.790
Don't end up dead in Mingshui
like Xiao Zhongwu!

18:48.110 --> 18:49.190
Soldiers of Wei

18:50.030 --> 18:51.390
will never surrender!

18:51.630 --> 18:53.110
- Never surrender!
- Never surrender!

18:53.390 --> 18:55.150
- Never surrender!
- Never surrender!

18:56.110 --> 18:57.030
Charge!

18:57.150 --> 18:58.910
- Charge!
- Charge!

21:40.080 --> 21:43.070
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

21:43.070 --> 21:45.980
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

21:45.980 --> 21:51.680
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

21:51.680 --> 21:54.780
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

21:54.780 --> 21:57.540
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

21:57.540 --> 22:03.850
♪Holding hands tight,
we make a commitment♪

22:05.010 --> 22:07.560
♪I can't forget or break free♪

22:07.920 --> 22:10.660
♪Shatter all shackles♪

22:10.930 --> 22:15.140
♪No matter what, I can't let you go♪

22:16.370 --> 22:21.460
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

22:22.160 --> 22:26.780
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

22:28.080 --> 22:32.740
♪Let time's sails drift through,
wandering around♪

22:33.430 --> 22:40.430
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

22:41.760 --> 22:44.450
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

22:44.450 --> 22:47.350
♪Fearless heart remains silent♪

22:47.350 --> 22:53.180
♪Let me repeat destiny's cycle♪

22:53.180 --> 22:56.260
♪I laughed it off♪

22:56.260 --> 22:59.210
♪The galaxy still shines brightly♪

22:59.210 --> 23:04.990
♪Remember to always live for love♪

23:04.990 --> 23:07.550
♪Hold a spear♪

23:07.550 --> 23:10.880
♪And fight♪

23:10.880 --> 23:13.790
♪Never stop♪

23:13.790 --> 23:20.700
♪Move on♪

23:25.360 --> 23:27.520
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

23:27.630 --> 23:31.550
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

23:31.550 --> 23:33.670
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

23:33.670 --> 23:38.750
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

23:51.320 --> 23:54.250
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

23:55.510 --> 23:57.150
- We won!
- We won!

23:58.830 --> 23:59.710
- We won!
- We won!

24:00.190 --> 24:01.830
- We won!
- We won!

24:02.900 --> 24:05.060
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

24:05.160 --> 24:09.080
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

24:09.080 --> 24:11.200
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

24:11.200 --> 24:15.220
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

24:15.220 --> 24:17.160
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

24:17.340 --> 24:21.170
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

24:21.420 --> 24:27.170
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

24:28.060 --> 24:32.140
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

24:32.150 --> 24:34.790
Chu Zhao,
Vice Director of the Secretariat,

24:35.070 --> 24:36.830
prioritized personal desires

24:36.830 --> 24:38.150
and sowed discord repeatedly,

24:38.750 --> 24:40.790
making the military strength divided,

24:41.070 --> 24:43.550
allowing Wutuo's invasion.

24:43.710 --> 24:45.310
War reignited,

24:45.390 --> 24:47.070
causing immense suffering.

24:47.630 --> 24:49.990
He is hereby dismissed

24:50.230 --> 24:51.830
and exiled to the borderlands

24:52.110 --> 24:53.710
and will never return.

24:54.190 --> 24:55.830
By Imperial Decree.

24:57.750 --> 24:58.830
Thanks for your hard work.

24:59.430 --> 25:00.270
Rise, please.

25:00.790 --> 25:01.710
Thank you.

25:06.870 --> 25:07.710
Your Majesty.

25:07.990 --> 25:08.870
Amidst urgent warfare,

25:09.150 --> 25:10.750
I prioritized military necessity,

25:11.150 --> 25:11.990
leaving Rundu

25:12.270 --> 25:13.110
without permission.

25:13.550 --> 25:15.350
This defied imperial orders.

25:15.830 --> 25:16.870
I deserve punishment.

25:17.950 --> 25:18.790
Your Majesty.

25:19.870 --> 25:21.550
General Feihong
contributed to the victory.

25:21.710 --> 25:22.750
She committed no crime.

25:24.470 --> 25:25.310
Good judgment.

25:25.830 --> 25:26.670
Xiao Jue, you also

25:26.750 --> 25:27.870
contributed to the victory.

25:28.190 --> 25:29.070
Rewards for you both

25:29.230 --> 25:30.630
have been sent to your mansions.

25:30.950 --> 25:31.790
Well,

25:32.310 --> 25:33.590
you may leave.

25:34.670 --> 25:36.030
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

25:52.750 --> 25:53.590
Yan He.

25:56.510 --> 25:57.630
Actually,

25:58.510 --> 25:59.590
when I married you,

26:01.230 --> 26:02.070
I knew

26:04.390 --> 26:05.830
this day might come.

26:08.270 --> 26:09.430
But I never expected

26:11.310 --> 26:12.670
that it'd happen so soon.

26:21.830 --> 26:22.790
But don't worry.

26:23.390 --> 26:24.390
Since I've married you,

26:25.710 --> 26:26.950
I'll never regret it.

26:29.870 --> 26:30.950
No matter how difficult,

26:32.910 --> 26:34.230
I'll live on resolutely

26:38.550 --> 26:40.270
and raise our child well.

26:53.310 --> 26:54.150
Muxia.

26:55.710 --> 26:56.550
Muxia.

26:56.910 --> 26:58.430
May you grow up healthy.

26:59.710 --> 27:00.950
Your father

27:01.550 --> 27:03.350
will surely watch over you.

27:56.430 --> 27:57.270
Careful!

27:59.350 --> 28:00.270
Slow down!

28:09.670 --> 28:11.190
Soldiers fight on the battlefield

28:11.630 --> 28:13.350
for this peaceful life.

28:14.310 --> 28:15.230
If Yan He

28:15.470 --> 28:16.310
could see this,

28:16.950 --> 28:18.350
he might rest in peace.

28:19.670 --> 28:20.510
Sadly,

28:21.110 --> 28:22.110
he and Chengxiu

28:22.870 --> 28:24.110
are already separated by death.

28:26.910 --> 28:27.750
Huaijin,

28:28.550 --> 28:29.430
we promised each other

28:30.150 --> 28:30.990
to face the future

28:31.350 --> 28:32.870
and cherish every single day.

28:33.550 --> 28:34.390
Even if eventually...

28:34.470 --> 28:35.830
Even if one of us dies in battle,

28:36.710 --> 28:38.710
the other one must keep living
courageously

28:39.390 --> 28:42.030
to see our nation's splendor and peace.

28:46.160 --> 28:49.790
(General Feihong's Mansion)

28:52.350 --> 28:53.750
This road feels too short.

28:54.230 --> 28:56.030
If only we could walk longer together.

28:56.550 --> 28:57.390
We have time.

29:00.470 --> 29:01.590
I'll always stay with you.

29:03.190 --> 29:04.550
We live together when we're alive.

29:05.350 --> 29:06.190
After death, we'll be

29:06.910 --> 29:07.750
buried together.

29:10.990 --> 29:12.270
I'll give you a spot beside me.

29:15.470 --> 29:16.710
Who asked you to do that?

29:17.390 --> 29:19.390
I'm the renowned General Feihong!

29:23.430 --> 29:24.270
Well,

29:25.390 --> 29:26.710
you keep a spot for me?

29:27.870 --> 29:28.710
You wish.

29:32.530 --> 29:35.330
(General Feihong's Mansion)

29:43.630 --> 29:44.470
Excuse me,

29:44.670 --> 29:45.630
if I may interject?

29:48.870 --> 29:50.030
Stop talking

29:50.190 --> 29:51.150
about the spot.

29:51.710 --> 29:52.830
An imperial edict arrived.

29:52.950 --> 29:53.790
Come and take it.

29:58.510 --> 30:02.190
(General Feihong's Mansion)
By Heaven's Mandate,

30:02.630 --> 30:05.110
Xiao Jue, General Fengyun,

30:05.790 --> 30:09.030
is accomplished, loyal, and valiant.

30:09.670 --> 30:11.710
He Yan, General Feihong,

30:12.310 --> 30:15.550
is a heroine
of unmatched talent and brilliance.

30:15.990 --> 30:18.190
Both are loyal generals

30:18.270 --> 30:19.910
and pillars of Wei.

30:20.590 --> 30:22.430
I hereby grant you marriage.

30:22.670 --> 30:25.350
May you two stay together happily

30:25.590 --> 30:29.110
and guard borders and people together.

30:29.350 --> 30:31.230
That's all!

30:34.070 --> 30:35.790
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

31:08.950 --> 31:13.570
(One month later)

31:16.600 --> 31:19.970
(General Feihong's Mansion)

31:19.970 --> 31:23.170
(General Feihong's Mansion)

31:24.830 --> 31:25.870
So the bride is the first

31:25.950 --> 31:26.830
female general.

31:26.910 --> 31:27.750
Truly remarkable!

31:27.750 --> 31:28.790
Look, how magnificent!

32:03.470 --> 32:04.790
- Here they are!
- Here they are!

32:14.910 --> 32:15.750
(Prosperity)
Careful.

32:18.160 --> 32:21.570
(Wedding Procession)

32:40.790 --> 32:44.350
(Xiao Mansion)

32:44.350 --> 32:47.630
It's a wedding ceremony

32:48.590 --> 32:50.910
of two families.

32:52.110 --> 32:54.430
A man and a woman are getting married

32:55.310 --> 32:58.590
as promised.

33:41.080 --> 33:42.810
♪Constant yearning♪

33:43.270 --> 33:47.040
♪Still vivid as our first meeting♪

33:48.260 --> 33:50.270
♪Endless gazing♪

33:50.840 --> 33:54.270
♪Step by step, falling deeper♪

33:54.790 --> 33:56.660
♪How to untangle this love♪

33:56.940 --> 34:02.430
♪Buried deep within dreams♪

34:03.610 --> 34:08.850
♪My heart, unyielding as stone,
remains true♪

34:10.110 --> 34:14.230
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

34:14.230 --> 34:17.020
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

34:17.510 --> 34:24.270
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

34:24.360 --> 34:28.550
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

34:28.550 --> 34:29.630
(The last secret.)

34:32.230 --> 34:33.550
I love the moon.

34:34.110 --> 34:35.389
Yet the moon doesn't know.

34:37.989 --> 34:38.830
Now,

34:40.550 --> 34:41.630
the moon is yours.

34:51.159 --> 34:57.390
♪In the vast world,
I searched for years♪

34:58.560 --> 35:04.350
♪Shadows hustle. Scenes reappear♪

35:04.960 --> 35:06.810
♪What is there to fear♪

35:07.150 --> 35:12.850
♪We'll weather storms together♪

35:13.730 --> 35:19.600
♪Through endless dawns and dusks,
to eternity♪

35:20.260 --> 35:24.380
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

35:24.380 --> 35:27.360
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

35:27.360 --> 35:34.270
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

35:34.270 --> 35:38.720
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

35:38.720 --> 35:42.850
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

35:45.470 --> 35:46.310
Yan,

35:46.550 --> 35:47.590
I'm afraid you feel bored,

35:47.670 --> 35:48.590
so I came to chat.

35:50.830 --> 35:51.670
Yan?

35:53.030 --> 35:53.870
Taotao,

35:54.110 --> 35:55.070
have you seen Huaijin?

35:55.750 --> 35:57.350
Isn't he toasting guests right now?

35:57.990 --> 35:58.830
I've searched.

35:58.830 --> 35:59.670
Didn't find him.

36:24.710 --> 36:25.550
They say

36:25.590 --> 36:28.190
the moonlight over Mount Cuiwang
is peerless.

36:28.510 --> 36:29.870
Let's watch it tonight.

36:30.310 --> 36:31.150
Peerless?

36:31.830 --> 36:32.670
I doubt it.

36:32.670 --> 36:35.780
♪Walking through the crowd,
without asking about the future♪

36:37.670 --> 36:38.510
It seems

36:39.110 --> 36:40.510
the peerless moon

36:40.950 --> 36:41.790
is feeling jealous.

36:45.310 --> 36:51.890
♪I failed to let it go and kept looking♪

36:52.540 --> 36:58.240
♪Longing continues,
as feelings are changing♪

37:00.380 --> 37:02.640
♪Just to see you turn around♪

37:03.270 --> 37:04.470
The peerless moon

37:05.990 --> 37:06.830
is yours now.

37:07.420 --> 37:12.970
♪Just to tread the snow you described♪

37:13.890 --> 37:20.360
♪The more fate intertwines intensely,
the further we drift apart♪

37:20.670 --> 37:26.750
♪It's hard to sever love or hatred♪

37:26.750 --> 37:27.590
Xiao Jue.

37:29.830 --> 37:30.670
Tell me,

37:31.430 --> 37:33.230
in 10 years, 20 years,

37:33.750 --> 37:34.990
even 50 years from now,

37:35.390 --> 37:37.390
how will the moon differ from tonight's?

37:40.550 --> 37:41.390
I don't know.

37:42.870 --> 37:43.910
I wonder what the moon

37:44.430 --> 37:45.670
will be like decades from now,

37:46.110 --> 37:46.990
compared to

37:47.150 --> 37:48.070
the present one.

37:51.670 --> 37:52.590
I'm also curious.

37:54.350 --> 37:55.190
So,

37:56.950 --> 37:57.790
let's watch together.

38:06.780 --> 38:11.260
(The End)

38:11.590 --> 38:13.750
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

38:13.850 --> 38:17.770
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

38:17.950 --> 38:19.890
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

38:19.990 --> 38:24.920
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

38:37.010 --> 38:38.420
♪I've seen the mountains♪

38:38.620 --> 38:40.030
♪And trodden through ice♪

38:40.300 --> 38:43.120
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

38:43.420 --> 38:44.810
♪Destiny is my creed♪

38:44.870 --> 38:46.270
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

38:46.420 --> 38:48.220
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

38:49.420 --> 38:50.890
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

38:51.060 --> 38:52.340
♪Gazing through the mire♪

38:52.520 --> 38:54.910
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

38:55.110 --> 38:57.160
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

38:58.300 --> 39:00.130
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

39:02.090 --> 39:05.000
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

39:05.090 --> 39:07.760
♪There must always be a longing♪

39:08.210 --> 39:13.270
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

39:13.610 --> 39:15.610
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

39:15.930 --> 39:19.570
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

39:19.810 --> 39:21.700
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

39:21.730 --> 39:25.580
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

39:25.930 --> 39:27.870
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

39:28.060 --> 39:31.880
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

39:32.140 --> 39:37.890
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

39:38.780 --> 39:44.240
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

39:51.400 --> 39:54.320
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

39:54.410 --> 39:57.070
